  "title": "Saturated $k$-Sperner Systems of Minimum Size",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Question Does there exist a constant $c>1/2$ and a function $n_0(k)$ such that if $|X|\\geq n_0(k)$, then every saturated $k$-Sperner system $\\mathcal{F}\\subseteq \\mathcal{P}(X)$ has cardinality at least $2^{(1+o(1))ck}$?",
